.{
    // A012 is a rule aegis declares (its lint_rules, read from the pinned aegis), on where a project
    // selects it: std's list or queue type reached through each way a name is held, and the same
    // way reaching bounded's; the call row's twins inside the seam the case declares.
    // A target is a declaration, reached only by a name evaluated as the program compiles; memory
    // a load or store moves holds runtime values, never a name.
    .na = .{.memory},
}
